/data/*
# Deliberate exception: data/fibo_live/v1/events.jsonl is the Fibo live
# paper-trading forward test's own evidence log (this laptop's trading
# decisions, logged before outcomes were known), not NSE market data --
# the licensing rationale for ignoring the rest of data/ does not apply
# to it. Tracked so a crash doesn't restart the forward test, and so each
# commit's own timestamp is independent evidence a signal was logged
# before its outcome existed. See OPERATIONS.md. Re-including a file deep
# inside an otherwise-ignored tree requires un-ignoring (and re-ignoring
# the rest of) every parent directory in turn, per gitignore(5) -- a
# single `!data/fibo_live/v1/events.jsonl` on its own would not work.
!/data/fibo_live
/data/fibo_live/*
!/data/fibo_live/v1
/data/fibo_live/v1/*
!/data/fibo_live/v1/events.jsonl
.pytest_cache/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.claude/
*.log
.DS_Store

# Angel One SmartAPI credentials and cached session/tokens (src/fibo/) --
# never commit real keys, TOTP secrets, JWTs, or feed tokens.
.env
*.token
*.session
angel_token_cache*

# smartapi-python's own default log location (SmartApi/smartConnect.py
# creates logs/<date>/app.log relative to CWD, and logs raw request params
# -- including MPIN/TOTP on a failed login -- at ERROR level; see
# src/fibo/auth.py's module docstring for the neutralization this project
# applies before any credential-bearing call). *.log already covers the
# file itself; this also covers the dated directory it lives in.
/logs/

